  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Transfer matrices and their eigenvalues\n`tL2[a, u, M]` is the two-site $t_a$ with twist $M$ on the right (memoized); `tL1[s, a, u, M]` is the one-site $t_a$ of site $s$. The insertions are never formed as matrices. Their covectors act factor by factor on $\\langle\\Omega|$ (Section 4), and their eigenvalues are CBR determinants of the scalar $t_a$ eigenvalues (`evT`), with $t_3$ the quantum determinant. Checks: quantum determinant, commutativity, and `evT` against an explicit fused matrix.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "lax1[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN EN[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntwistR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n(* two-site monodromy blocks: (L^(1) L^(2))_ij = Σ_k L1_ik ⊗ L2_kj *)\nlax2[x_] := lax2[x] = With[{L1 = lax1[1, x], L2 = lax1[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[L1[[i, k]]], SparseArray[L2[[k, j]]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nmono2[M_][x_] := twistR[lax2[x], M];\nmono1[s_, M_][x_] := twistR[lax1[s, x], M];\n(* t_a: principal quantum minors, rows antisymmetrized, k-th factor at x-(k-1)h *)\ntq[mono_, a_, x_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono[x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntL2[a_, x_, M_] := tL2[a, x, M] = tq[mono2[M], a, x];\ntL1[s_, a_, x_, M_] := tq[mono1[s, M], a, x];\n(* CBR: T_λ(x) = det t_{λ'_j+i-j}(x+(i-1)h), t_0 = 1, t_a = 0 outside 0..3 *)\nconj[λ_] := Table[Count[λ, y_ /; y >= j], {j, Max[λ]}];\ncbr[tf_, λ_, x_, idm_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0, Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[If[as[[i]] == 0, idm, tf[as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN]], {i, n}]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\nTL1[s_, λ_, x_, M_] := cbr[tL1[s, #1, #2, M] &, λ, x, id1];\nnu[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, 2}];\nqdetS[zv_, x_] := (Times @@ zv) nu[1][x] nu[2][x - hN] nu[3][x - 2 hN];\nmaxAbs[m_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[{Normal[m]}]]];\n(* scalar eigenvalues on an eigenvector Ψ at diagonal twist zv *)\ntEv[Ψ_, a_, x_, zv_] := Which[a == 0, 1, a == 3, qdetS[zv, x], True, With[{k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]]}, (tL2[a, x, DiagonalMatrix[zv]] . Ψ)[[k]]/Ψ[[k]]]];\nevT[λ_, x_, Ψ_, zv_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0, Signature[σ] Product[tEv[Ψ, as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN, zv], {i, n}]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\nZt = DiagonalMatrix[N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]];\n{tt, tests} = AbsoluteTiming[{\n    maxAbs[tL2[3, 1/3, Zt] - qdetS[Diagonal[Zt], 1/3] idm2],\n    maxAbs[With[{A = tL2[1, 1/3, Zt], B = tL2[2, -2/5, Zt]}, A . B - B . A]]}];\nGrid[{{\"qdet residual\", tests[[1]]}, {\"[t1(1/3), t2(-2/5)]\", tests[[2]]}, {\"time (s)\", tt}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
