  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Clean combinations and the fair end-to-end test\nIn each HW sector, the **sector clean space** is the null space of the stacked leading contamination vectors $k_B$ of all copies $B$, fitted at $(\\varepsilon=10^{-5},\\varphi,\\omega)$. A $k$ below `kTol` $=10^{-2}$ is $O(\\varepsilon)$ noise from an already-clean insertion and imposes no constraint. If the clean covectors restricted to $\\mathrm{HW}_\\mu$ over five $w$ have full rank (= multiplicity), the sector space is used. Otherwise each copy uses its own null space (**per-copy cleaning**).\n\nFor each state, the data are the Q-side numbers $q_\\lambda$ only. Least squares of $v\\cdot q(w)=\\big(v\\cdot d(w)\\big)|_{\\mathrm{HW}_\\mu}\\cdot a$ over the clean $v$ and five $w$ gives $a$, which is compared with the true $\\texttt{hwB}[\\mu]\\cdot\\Psi$ (direction **and** scale). The test points are $(10^{-4},\\varphi)$ and $(10^{-5},\\varphi')$, both different from the fit point. The digits column is `Precision` of the error, as a guard against zero-accuracy fake zeros.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "kTol = 10^-2;\nnullOf[rows_] := With[{rr = Select[rows, Norm[#] > kTol &]}, If[rr === {}, IdentityMatrix[nL],\n    Module[{sv = SingularValueList[rr, Tolerance -> 0], r, V}, r = Count[sv, x_ /; x > 10^-3 Max[sv]]; V = SingularValueDecomposition[rr][[3]]; Transpose[V][[r + 1 ;;]]]]];\nkVec[μ_, c_] := normKS[KSm[μ, c, 10^-5], μ, c][[1]];\ncleanSec[μ_] := nullOf[Table[kVec[μ, c], {c, Length[hwB[μ]]}]];\ncleanCopy[μ_, c_] := nullOf[{kVec[μ, c]}];\nωSet = {ω, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}, {-3/5, 2/7, 1/3}, {5/6, 1/2, -1/8}, {2/9, -7/10, 3/4}};\nhwRank[μ_, vs_, ε_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φ], m}, m = Flatten[Table[With[{ds = dCovs[zv, wOf[ε, ωv]]}, Table[hwB[μ] . (v . ds), {v, vs}]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1];\n   N[SingularValueList[m, Tolerance -> 0]/Norm[m], 3]];\nreconV[μ_, copy_, ε_, vs_, φv_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φv], Ψ, M, y, a, tru, re}, Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"];\n   {M, y} = Transpose[Flatten[Table[With[{wv = wOf[ε, ωv]}, With[{ds = dCovs[zv, wv], q = qNums[Ψ, zv, wv]}, Table[{hwB[μ] . (v . ds), v . q}, {v, vs}]]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1]];\n   a = LeastSquares[M, y]; tru = hwB[μ] . Ψ; re = Norm[a - tru]/Norm[tru]; {N[re, 3], Round[Precision[re]]}];\n{t6, tab6} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Module[{mult = Length[hwB[μ]], cs, rk, full},\n     cs = cleanSec[μ]; rk = Take[hwRank[μ, cs, 10^-5], UpTo[mult + 1]];\n     full = Length[rk] >= mult && rk[[mult]] > 10^-3;\n     {μ, mult, Length[cs], rk, Table[With[{vs = If[full, cs, cleanCopy[μ, c]]}, {If[full, \"sector\", \"per copy\"], Length[vs], reconV[μ, c, 10^-4, vs, φ], reconV[μ, c, 10^-5, vs, φp]}], {c, mult}]}], {μ, Rest[hwSecs]}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"mult\", \"dim sector clean space\", \"sector HW rel. sv (ε=10^-5)\", \"per copy: {space, dim, {rel. err, digits} at (10^-4, φ), at (10^-5, φ')}\"}}, tab6, {{\"time (s)\", t6, \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
