  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Results for $[3,2,0]^2$ (2026-10-02, P1 $=(h,\\theta)=(1/2,\\{2/7,-3/5\\})$, 150 digits, full run about 3 s)\n- **Checks.** The quantum determinant, commutativity and $\\Omega$ eigen-covector checks pass to $\\le10^{-140}$. The chain identity $d\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi=q$ holds to $10^{-111}$.\n- **Site-1 scan (Section 4).** The only nontrivial site-1-local shapes with $\\lambda_1\\le3$, $c=-5..1$, are **$T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,1)},T_{(3,1)}$ at $\\theta_1-3h$**, as in `L2-320-localization.md`. The fitted $f_\\lambda$ equal $(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$, $(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$, $(\\theta_{12}-h)^2(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$ to 10 digits.\n- **Structural.** The contamination ratios of all 9 non-top HW states are $\\varphi,\\omega$-independent, with spread $\\lesssim2\\times10^{-5}$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$.\n- **End to end, site 1 + $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ only.** All 9 non-top HW states are recovered from Q-side numbers, scale included. Relative errors are $10^{-4.1}$–$10^{-5.7}$ at $(10^{-4},\\varphi)$ and $10^{-5}$–$10^{-7.1}$ at $(10^{-5},\\varphi')$, i.e. $O(\\varepsilon)$, with $\\ge85$ correct digits.\n  - **Sector-wide cleaning is enough** for $[6,3,1]$, $[6,2,2]$, $[5,5,0]$, $[5,4,1]$ (multiplicity 2; HW rank 2, second singular value 0.06), $[4,4,2]$ and $[4,3,3]$.\n  - **$[5,3,2]$ (multiplicity 2) needs per-copy cleaning.** The sector clean space is 1-dimensional with HW rank 1; each copy's own clean space is 2-dimensional. This mirrors $[4,3,1]$ in $[3,1,0]^2$, consistent with $[3,2,0]\\cong[3,1,0]^*\\otimes\\det^3$, under which $[4,3,1]\\leftrightarrow[5,3,2]$.\n  - The bottom irrep $[4,3,3]$, which the site-1+site-2 reconstruction needed $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ for, is recovered sector-wide.\n- **Caveats, as for $[3,1,0]$.** The clean coefficients are fitted numerically, not in closed form. There is one chain point. The eigenvalues are read from the eigenvectors and stand in for the Q's.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
